<td id="S2.T1.4.1.81.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"><span id="S2.T1.4.1.81.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Skill vs. persistence (Eq. (</span><a href="#S4.E22" title="Equation 22 ‣ IV-E Metrics and Skill Relative to Persistence ‣ IV Transformer Baselines ‣ Rivaling Transformers: Multi-Scale Structured State-Space Mixtures for Agentic 6G O-RAN" class="ltx_ref" style="font-size:70%;"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a><span id="S2.T1.4.1.81.2.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">))</span></td>
<td id="S2.T1.4.1.81.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"><span id="S2.T1.4.1.81.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">scalars</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S2.T1.4.1.82" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S2.T1.4.1.82.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"><math id="S2.T1.m144" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta,\ \theta^{\star}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathsize="0.700em">θ</mi><mo mathsize="0.700em" rspace="0.577em">,</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.700em">θ</mi><mo mathsize="0.700em">⋆</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta,\ \theta^{\star}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td id="S2.T1.4.1.82.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"><span id="S2.T1.4.1.82.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">Parameters; best (early-stopped) params</span></td>
<td id="S2.T1.4.1.82.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;"><span id="S2.T1.4.1.82.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">—</span></td></tr>
