"0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi mathsize="0.800em">Y</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">(</mo><mi mathsize="0.800em" mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z^{(\ell)}=W_{\downarrow}^{(\ell)}\!\big(\phi(W_{\uparrow,a}^{(\ell)}Y^{(\ell)})\odot\sigma(W_{\uparrow,g}^{(\ell)}Y^{(\ell)})\big)</annotation></semantics></math><span id="alg1.l17.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">,
